# deploy/fleet/env.fleet.keys
#
# NAMES-ONLY manifest of every ${VAR} docker-compose.prod.yml +
# compose.infra.prod.yml INTERPOLATE at compose-parse time. Interpolation is
# resolved from a file literally named `.env` in the compose project
# directory (`deploy/fleet/`) — the `deploy/fleet/.env` -> `.env.fleet`
# symlink from the README's Step 0 — NEVER from the root `.env` that
# `env_file:` loads INSIDE the container. Those are two different
# mechanisms that do not substitute for each other; see README.md
# "deploy/fleet/.env — required, and NOT the same file as the root .env".
#
# THE INCIDENT this manifest exists to prevent (2026-09-16): agents'
# `${JULIA_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY:-}` interpolated to the empty string because
# JULIA_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY was only ever in the ROOT `.env` (per an earlier,
# WRONG version of the README's Julia/agents table) — every Julia turn
# failed silently at the CLI-spawn step while the container stayed healthy.
#
# `check_prod_compose_env_manifest_sync` (mcp/noctusai/tools/noctus/dev/
# compliance.py) cross-checks this file against every ${VAR} the two prod
# compose files actually interpolate — a name present in compose but absent
# here is flagged; a `${VAR:-}` empty-default whose name looks secret-shaped
# is flagged unconditionally (an empty default is the exact failure mode:
# the container boots and looks healthy on a silently-blank secret).
#
# NO VALUES here — this file IS committed. Real values live in the
# gitignored `deploy/fleet/.env.fleet` on the VPS; `.env.fleet.example`
# carries the value-template + per-var setup notes.
#
# KB § GUIDES/production-deploy.md § 6.

# ── Image tag (safe non-secret default: :-latest) ───────────────────────
NOCTUS_IMAGE_TAG

# ── Cache backend (Postgres + pgvector) — x-cache-env anchor ────────────
NOCTUS_CACHE_PG_PASSWORD
NOCTUS_CACHE_PG_DB
NOCTUS_CACHE_PG_USER

# ── LLM keys — SECRETS; an empty :- default silently disables the feature
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
JULIA_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY

# ── WAHA (WhatsApp HTTP API, profile: waha) ──────────────────────────────
WAHA_IMAGE
WAHA_PLATFORM
WAHA_API_KEY
WAHA_DASHBOARD_USERNAME
WAHA_DASHBOARD_PASSWORD
